      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.31 (up from ₹0.72 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹382.2m (down 2.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹9.59m (up ₹14.9m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.5% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 3% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
